---
<section
  class="relative text-white pt-[50px] pb-[40px] overflow-hidden"
  style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,20,35,0.80) 0%, rgba(10,20,35,0.88) 100%), url('/Asset/stock%20photo/Desktop%20Dimensions/CTA-Image.png'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
    <h2 class="font-display text-white mb-6">
      Recovery Starts With One Honest Conversation
    </h2>
    <p class="font-body text-white/80 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      You don't need to have everything figured out before you call. Our team is available right now — day or night — to answer your questions, check your coverage, and help you take the next step.
    </p>
    <a href="tel:8883625576" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-white hover:bg-cream text-black font-bold px-10 py-5 rounded transition-colors font-body tracking-wide text-base">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 5V3z"/>
      </svg>
      Call Now — (888) 362-5576
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer bar -->
  <div class="mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs font-body text-white/40">
      <img src="/Asset/stock%20photo/Logo%20Buena%20Vista.svg" alt="Buena Vista Health & Recovery Centers" class="h-6 brightness-0 invert opacity-40" />
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Buena Vista Health & Recovery Centers · 3033 S Arizona Ave, Chandler, AZ 85286</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
